00:25:09,540 --> 00:25:11,840
おおー！すごい！
Ooh! Awesome!

390
00:25:13,040 --> 00:25:15,540
すごい！楽しい！
Awesome! This is so fun!

391
00:25:15,540 --> 00:25:17,540
控えめに言って最高！
To put it mildly, this is the best!

392
00:25:17,540 --> 00:25:20,840
もっと大きい！めっちゃさあ...
Even bigger! It's super...

393
00:25:20,840 --> 00:25:22,540
夏祭りしたかった！
I wanted to go to a summer festival!

394
00:25:22,540 --> 00:25:25,040
夏祭り感ある！
It really feels like a summer festival!

395
00:25:25,040 --> 00:25:27,540
ホロライブで夏祭りできて最高！
Doing a summer festival in Hololive is the best!

396
00:25:27,540 --> 00:25:30,840
夏祭り行ったことない...
I've never been to a summer festival...

397
00:25:30,840 --> 00:25:33,040
でもこれ以上出ない！
But no more will come out!

398
00:25:33,040 --> 00:25:35,040
そうなの！？ヤバいじゃん！
Is that so!? That's crazy!

399
00:25:35,040 --> 00:25:37,040
コップも回っていけない、これ！
The cup can't even spin like this!

400
00:25:37,040 --> 00:25:39,540
まあまあまあ、大丈夫。一応そうめん屋...
Well, it's fine. It's technically a somen shop...

401
00:25:39,540 --> 00:25:41,540
本当？そうめん屋なんだ！
Really? So it is a somen shop!

402
00:25:41,540 --> 00:25:44,040
そうめん屋なんです。
Yes, it's a somen shop.

403
00:25:44,040 --> 00:25:46,540
え、待って！ビジューめっちゃ上手くない！？
Wait, isn't Bijou super good at this!?

404
00:25:46,540 --> 00:25:49,040
オッケー、オッケー！もうちょっと行こうか、もうちょっとね。
Okay, okay! Let's do a bit more, just a little bit.

405
00:25:49,040 --> 00:25:51,540
ビジューめっちゃ上手いやん！
Bijou is ridiculously good at this!

406
00:25:51,540 --> 00:25:53,840
上手い、上手い！
Nice, nice!

407
00:25:53,840 --> 00:25:56,040
すみません、じゃあそうめんください！
Excuse me, then please give me some somen!

408
00:25:56,040 --> 00:25:58,040
お願いします！
Please!

409
00:25:58,040 --> 00:26:00,840
えー、じゃあ流すよ！
Okay, I'm sending it down!

410
00:26:00,840 --> 00:26:03,540
くるくるくるくる...
Round and round...

411
00:26:03,540 --> 00:26:06,040
おおー！
Ooh!

412
00:26:06,040 --> 00:26:08,540
行くよー！
Here it comes!

413
00:26:08,540 --> 00:26:11,840
イエーイ！おおー！
Yay! Ooh!

414
00:26:11,840 --> 00:26:14,040
オッケー！
Okay!

415
00:26:14,040 --> 00:26:17,040
ヤバい、これピカチュウで詰まるんだよね、いつも。
Oh no, it always gets stuck on Pikachu.

416
00:26:17,040 --> 00:26:20,040
キャー！取れた！
Eek! I caught it!

417
00:26:20,040 --> 00:26:22,040
すごい！ありがとう！
Amazing! Thank you!

418
00:26:22,040 --> 00:26:24,040
これあとで食べます！いただきます！
I'll eat this later! Bon appetit!

419
00:26:24,040 --> 00:26:26,540
Very nice! Very nice!

420
00:26:26,540 --> 00:26:29,040
美味い！
Delicious!

421
00:26:29,040 --> 00:26:31,540
すごーい！
Amazing!

422
00:26:31,540 --> 00:26:34,040
えー！美味い！ビジュー！
Eh! Delicious! Bijou!

423
00:26:34,040 --> 00:26:37,040
ビジュー、ヨーヨー釣りも全部上手いやん！
Bijou, you're so good at yo-yo fishing too!

424
00:26:37,040 --> 00:26:39,040
すげー！上手くてよかった！
Awesome! I'm glad you're good at it!

425
00:26:39,040 --> 00:26:41,040
そうめん食べる？食った！
Want to eat somen? I ate it!

426
00:26:41,040 --> 00:26:43,040
うん、食べます！
Yeah, I'll eat!

427
00:26:43,040 --> 00:26:46,040
え、ネリッサのさ、ビジュー...スバルが流すからさ、食べない？
Hey, Nerissa... Subaru is streaming, so why don't we eat?

428
00:26:46,040 --> 00:26:48,540
2人でさ、一緒にさ...
The two of us, together...

429
00:26:48,540 --> 00:26:50,540
いいの？やっておじ！
Is it okay? Let's do it!

430
00:26:50,540 --> 00:26:53,040
しょうがないな...
Guess we have to...

431
00:26:53,040 --> 00:26:55,540
食べたい？食べて！
Do you want to eat? Eat!

432
00:26:55,540 --> 00:26:58,040
食べる？いいよ！
Eating? Sure!

433
00:26:58,040 --> 00:27:00,040
これ食べていいよ！
You can eat this!

434
00:27:00,040 --> 00:27:02,540
みんなにここで見せる？
Shall we show everyone here?

435
00:27:02,540 --> 00:27:05,540
みんなー！ほらー！
Everyone! Look!

436
00:27:05,540 --> 00:27:08,540
ビジューのコットンキャンディです！
It's Bijou's cotton candy!

437
00:27:08,540 --> 00:27:11,540
わたあめ！わたあめ！
Cotton candy! Cotton candy!

438
00:27:11,540 --> 00:27:13,840
ビジューが取ったヨーヨーも見せて！
Show the yo-yo that Bijou got too!

439
00:27:13,840 --> 00:27:16,540
ほら！
Look!

440
00:27:16,540 --> 00:27:19,540
これ光るからね！光るから！
Because this glows! It glows!

441
00:27:19,540 --> 00:27:22,540
すごいやん、ビジュー！ナイスナイス！
That's awesome, Bijou! Nice, nice!

442
00:27:22,540 --> 00:27:25,040
じゃあビジュー、今から流しそうめん...
Then Bijou, now for the nagashi somen...

443
00:27:25,040 --> 00:27:28,040
じゃあこれ一旦...オッケー！
Then let's put this aside for a bit... Okay!

444
00:27:28,040 --> 00:27:31,040
これ置く場所欲しいね。
We need a place to set this down.

445
00:27:31,040 --> 00:27:33,540
ネリッサが...あ、見て！
Nerissa is... Ah, look!

446
00:27:33,540 --> 00:27:36,040
どこに捨てちゃったの、これ！？ありがとうございます！
Where did you throw this away!? Thank you very much!

447
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:38,840
ギャー！ネリッサ食べんといて！
Gyaa! Nerissa, don't eat that!

448
00:27:38,840 --> 00:27:41,540
それビジューのコットンキャンディ...
That's Bijou's cotton candy...

449
00:27:41,540 --> 00:27:44,040
食べたい！んー、美味いです！
I want to eat it! Mm, it's delicious!

450
00:27:44,040 --> 00:27:46,540
美味い！？ネリッサわたあめ作った？
Delicious!? Nerissa, did you make cotton candy?

451
00:27:46,540 --> 00:27:48,840
You try? はい！
You try? Yes!

452
00:27:48,840 --> 00:27:51,540
わたあめは美味しいです！
Cotton candy is delicious!

453
00:27:51,540 --> 00:27:54,540
わたあめ美味しい！でも私のスキルですわ！
Cotton candy is delicious! But that's thanks to my skill!

454
00:27:54,540 --> 00:27:57,040
あはは！ちょっと下手です。
Ahaha! It's a bit unskillful.

455
00:27:57,040 --> 00:28:00,040
あ、なるほどね！はいはい！楽しめばいいからね！
Ah, I see! Right, right! As long as you enjoy it!

456
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:03,040
あ、ミオちゃんも...何その...
Ah, Mio-chan too... What is that...

457
00:28:03,040 --> 00:28:06,040
刺身！これわたあめ作ったら出来た！
Sashimi! I made this while making cotton candy!

458
00:28:06,040 --> 00:28:08,540
ねぇ...汚い、なんか！
Hey... it looks kind of dirty!

459
00:28:08,540 --> 00:28:11,540
なんか...よし！
Kind of... Alright!

460
00:28:11,540 --> 00:28:14,040
なんか嫌だ。それ見せてあげて、ちょっと。
I kind of don't like it. Show that to them for a bit.

461
00:28:14,040 --> 00:28:17,040
じゃあこれ...意外と高画質。
Then this... Surprisingly high quality.

462
00:28:17,040 --> 00:28:19,840
デッカい方のが高画質か。
So the bigger one is higher quality.

463
00:28:19,840 --> 00:28:22,540
嫌だ！それやめて！
No! Stop that!

464
00:28:22,540 --> 00:28:25,540
やめてよー！やめてよ！見せないで、それ！
Stop it~! Stop it! Don't show that!

465
00:28:25,540 --> 00:28:28,040
わたあめの欠片...ミオちゃん！
A piece of cotton candy... Mio-chan!

466
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:30,540
はい！わたあめ流すのやる、一緒に？
Yes! Do you want to try sending cotton candy down together?

467
00:28:30,540 --> 00:28:33,040
わたあめは流さないで！
Don't send cotton candy down!

468
00:28:33,040 --> 00:28:35,540
ごめん、わたあめは流さない！
Sorry, we won't send cotton candy down!

469
00:28:35,540 --> 00:28:38,040
そうめんを流すのですが、やりますか？
We're going to send somen down, do you want to do it?

470
00:28:38,040 --> 00:28:41,040
やるか！うちも食べたことないから！
Let me try! I've never eaten it before either!

471
00:28:41,040 --> 00:28:43,540
そうめん流しな！よし、それじゃあ行くよ！
Nagashi somen, right! Alright, here we go then!

472
00:28:43,540 --> 00:28:46,040
ちょっと待って！タレない！タレない、うち！
Wait a second! I don't have sauce! I don't have dipping sauce!

473
00:28:46,040 --> 00:28:48,540
タレ作って！そこにあるから！おいじゃあ...
Make some sauce! It's right over there! Okay then...

474
00:28:48,540 --> 00:28:51,040
よいしょ、作りました！
Yoisho, I made it!

475
00:28:51,040 --> 00:28:53,840
懐かしい！なんか我が家でやったときもさ...
Nostalgic! Like when we did it at our house...

476
00:28:53,840 --> 00:28:57,040
周りの水こうなったなってめっちゃ思う！
I distinctly remember the surrounding water getting like this!

477
00:28:57,040 --> 00:28:59,840
でしょ？マジこんなんだったよね！
Right? It was totally like this!

478
00:28:59,840 --> 00:29:02,540
そう！めちゃくちゃこうでした！
Yeah! It was completely like this!

479
00:29:02,540 --> 00:29:05,040
じゃあ... Oh, it's so wet!
Well then... Oh, it's so wet!

480
00:29:05,040 --> 00:29:08,040
Yeah. Oh, be careful of this.

481
00:29:08,040 --> 00:29:10,540
Yes, okay. じゃあ行くよ、2人とも！
Yes, okay. Alright, here goes, you two!

482
00:29:10,540 --> 00:29:13,040
イエーイ！You can do it!
Yay! You can do it!

483
00:29:13,040 --> 00:29:16,040
You can do it! いけ、スコ！
You can do it! Go for it, Suko!

484
00:29:16,040 --> 00:29:18,840
Wow! Can I take it from anywhere?

485
00:29:18,840 --> 00:29:21,040
Yeah! Oh, I can!

486
00:29:21,040 --> 00:29:23,540
Did you catch it? Ha!

487
00:29:23,540 --> 00:29:26,540
頑張れ！頑張れ！
Do your best! Do your best!

488
00:29:26,540 --> 00:29:29,040
Nice catch, Bae! イエーイ！
Nice catch, Bae! Yay!

489
00:29:29,040 --> 00:29:31,540
行くよ！ Your turn, your turn!
Here I go! Your turn, your turn!

490
00:29:31,540 --> 00:29:34,040
来い！頑張れ！
Come on! Do your best!

491
00:29:34,040 --> 00:29:38,040
おおー！上手い！
Ooh! Nice catch!

492
00:29:38,040 --> 00:29:41,040
行くよー！ More! More!
Here I go! More! More!

493
00:29:41,040 --> 00:29:44,040
More! More! More!

494
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:47,040
もっとー！もっとー！
More~! More~!

495
00:29:47,040 --> 00:29:50,040
はい、どうぞー！
Here you go~!

496
00:29:50,040 --> 00:29:53,040
よいしょ！キャー！
Yoisho! Kyaa!

497
00:29:53,040 --> 00:29:56,040
キャー！すごい！
Kyaa! Amazing!

498
00:29:56,040 --> 00:30:00,040
上手いやんビジュー！でも上手い上手い！
You're so good at this, Bijou! But nice, nice!

499
00:30:00,148 --> 00:30:01,348
これだ、これ！ / いやいやいや！
That's it, that's it! / No, no, no!

500
00:30:01,348 --> 00:30:02,548
ダメダメダメ！
No, no, no!

501
00:30:03,548 --> 00:30:05,148
それズルだよ、みおちゃん！
That's cheating, Mio-chan!

502
00:30:05,148 --> 00:30:06,848
それダメー！
You can't do that!

503
00:30:07,048 --> 00:30:09,148
これママ、ママが食べるの、これ！
Mama's going to eat this one!

504
00:30:09,148 --> 00:30:11,848
いや、こっちね、みおちゃん。参加する人こっちね、ここ。
No, over here, Mio-chan. Participants go here.

505
00:30:12,048 --> 00:30:13,648
はい、じゃあもう一回ね。
All right, let's try again.

506
00:30:15,248 --> 00:30:17,348
Go! 行くよ、Go!
Go! Here it comes, go!

507
00:30:20,148 --> 00:30:22,048
No! あー！でもセーフ！
No! Ah, but safe!

508
00:30:22,248 --> 00:30:24,048
あ、いいやん、いいやん！
Oh, nice, nice!

509
00:30:24,048 --> 00:30:25,548
ナイス！あざっす！
Nice! Thank you!

510
00:30:25,548 --> 00:30:27,548
Try! Try! Try! / こっち、こっち。
Try! Try! Try! / Over here, over here.

511
00:30:28,048 --> 00:30:30,348
あ、みお先輩、一回！
Ah, Mio-senpai, one try!

512
00:30:31,048 --> 00:30:33,248
Mio turn! Mio turn!
Mio's turn! Mio's turn!

513
00:30:33,248 --> 00:30:35,348
来い！来い！ホッ！
Come on! Come on! Ha!

514
00:30:35,348 --> 00:30:38,248
おー！いいやん！
Oh! Nice!

515
00:30:38,848 --> 00:30:40,548
うわ、うねー！うめー！
Whoa, smooth! Delicious!

516
00:30:41,248 --> 00:30:43,048
フワモコ来た！
FuwaMoco is here!

517
00:30:45,848 --> 00:30:48,048
すごい、お祭りが！
Wow, a festival!

518
00:30:48,048 --> 00:30:50,848
お！上手い！上手い！
Oh! You're good! So good!

519
00:30:50,848 --> 00:30:52,548
美味しい！でも...
Delicious! But...

520
00:30:53,048 --> 00:30:55,248
Melt? What is it? / 溶けてる、溶けてる。
Melt? What is it? / It's melting, it's melting.

521
00:30:55,248 --> 00:30:56,848
溶けてる！
It's melting!

522
00:30:56,848 --> 00:30:58,848
Look, I made that. I made this one.

523
00:30:58,848 --> 00:31:01,348
これ、ビブーが作ったんだよ。
Bijou made this one, you know!

524
00:31:01,348 --> 00:31:03,848
え、すごい！ビブちゃんが！
Eh, awesome! Bijou-chan did?!

525
00:31:04,048 --> 00:31:05,548
どうぞ！
Here you go!

526
00:31:05,548 --> 00:31:07,148
And I won this!

527
00:31:07,148 --> 00:31:09,548
何それ？ / I won this!
What's that? / I won this!

528
00:31:09,548 --> 00:31:12,348
これこれ、フワモコ、どうぞ！
Here, here, FuwaMoco, go ahead!

529
00:31:13,048 --> 00:31:15,548
大丈夫？あ、大丈夫？オッケー、オッケー！
Is it okay? Ah, okay? Okay, okay!

530
00:31:17,048 --> 00:31:21,048
じゃあフワモコ、これ食べて！
Well then, FuwaMoco, eat this!

531
00:31:21,548 --> 00:31:24,048
えー！りんご飴！そう！
Eh! Candy apples! Yes!

532
00:31:24,048 --> 00:31:27,548
すごい！めちゃ祭りだよ！
Amazing! It really feels like a festival!

533
00:31:29,048 --> 00:31:31,548
いくらさせるの？！ハマって、ハマって！
How much are you charging?! It's stuck, it's stuck!

534
00:31:32,548 --> 00:31:34,548
No, no... Biboo, how much is this?

535
00:31:36,548 --> 00:31:40,048
How much? How much is the cost?

536
00:31:40,048 --> 00:31:42,548
Put in the money? Yeah, I have money.

537
00:31:45,048 --> 00:31:47,348
いくら位する？
How much is it around?

538
00:31:48,048 --> 00:31:50,048
1,000? 1,000 yen!

539
00:31:50,048 --> 00:31:52,048
1,000円？
1,000 yen?

540
00:31:52,048 --> 00:31:54,048
100? 100? 流します。
100? 100? Sending it down.

541
00:31:54,048 --> 00:31:56,548
流してくれる？
Will you send it down?

542
00:31:57,048 --> 00:32:00,048
100万？！100万？！
1 million?! 1 million?!

543
00:32:00,048 --> 00:32:02,548
100万？！流します！
1 million?! Sending it down!

544
00:32:03,048 --> 00:32:06,048
えー、じゃあビブーさん、上手いから流しにまた流してあげて。
Well then, Biboo is so good at it, so send another one down for her.

545
00:32:07,048 --> 00:32:09,548
いやいやいや！
No, no, no!

546
00:32:10,048 --> 00:32:12,548
綿キャンディとフワモコ！
Cotton candy and FuwaMoco!

547
00:32:12,548 --> 00:32:14,548
あ、奥が良くなかった。流しますね！
Ah, the deep part was off. Sending it down!

548
00:32:14,548 --> 00:32:17,048
はい！お願いします！
Okay! Go ahead!

549
00:32:17,048 --> 00:32:18,548
ビブー上手い！
Biboo, you're good!

550
00:32:18,548 --> 00:32:21,048
So small! / ビブー！
So small! / Biboo!

551
00:32:21,048 --> 00:32:23,048
ホッ！ナイス！
Ha! Nice!

552
00:32:23,048 --> 00:32:25,548
オッケー！
Okay!

553
00:32:27,548 --> 00:32:30,048
また来ますよー！
Here comes another one!

554
00:32:30,548 --> 00:32:33,048
みおちゃん、どうですか？
Mio-chan, how is it?

555
00:32:33,048 --> 00:32:35,548
うん、美味しいよね！
Yeah, it's delicious, right?

556
00:32:35,548 --> 00:32:38,048
流しそうめん美味！
Flowing soumen is delicious!

557
00:32:38,048 --> 00:32:40,048
流しそうめん良いよね！
Flowing soumen is great, isn't it?

558
00:32:40,548 --> 00:32:43,048
I'm creating now!

559
00:32:43,048 --> 00:32:46,048
神コンセプト！これちょっと失敗になってきた。
God concept! This one is starting to fail a bit.

560
00:32:46,048 --> 00:32:48,548
これが失敗になってきた！
This is turning into a failure!

561
00:32:49,048 --> 00:32:51,548
大丈夫だよ！今からね、大丈夫だよ！
It's okay! From now on, it'll be fine!

562
00:32:52,048 --> 00:32:54,048
あれ？
Huh?

563
00:32:57,048 --> 00:32:59,048
今日ね、マジでハコスね...
Today, honestly, Hakos...

564
00:32:59,048 --> 00:33:02,048
作ってくれたから、いっぱい食べなきゃ！
...made so much for us, so we gotta eat a lot!

565
00:33:02,048 --> 00:33:05,048
Okay, which one do you want?

566
00:33:08,048 --> 00:33:10,548
チート台があるのかと思うと、ちょっと...
Thinking there might be a cheat station makes me feel...

567
00:33:10,548 --> 00:33:13,048
あと、いっぱいみんなに来てくれることを願うやん！
And we hope a lot of people come by!

568
00:33:13,048 --> 00:33:15,048
ね、みんな食べるために！
Right, for everyone to eat!

569
00:33:15,048 --> 00:33:17,548
みんな、いっぱい食べて！
Everyone, eat lots!

570
00:33:17,548 --> 00:33:20,048
ホッ！取れるかな？
Ha! Can I catch it?

571
00:33:20,048 --> 00:33:22,548
これ、量が多くない？
Isn't this a huge amount?

572
00:33:22,548 --> 00:33:25,048
持って、左...
Hold it, to the left...

573
00:33:25,048 --> 00:33:27,548
With Lunar... / いっぱいあるから...
With Lunar... / Because there's a lot...

574
00:33:27,548 --> 00:33:30,048
大丈夫かもね。
It might be fine.

575
00:33:31,548 --> 00:33:34,048
え、でもさ、このレックウザ、今回はみおちゃんに行くんでしょ？
But wait, this Rayquaza goes to Mio-chan this time, right?

576
00:33:34,048 --> 00:33:37,048
この棒の音が好き。うち車で来たから...
I like the sound of this stick. We came by car, so...

577
00:33:38,048 --> 00:33:40,548
キャー！
Eek!

578
00:33:42,048 --> 00:33:45,048
今回はね、飼い主のみおちゃんのところにレックウザも帰るみたいです。
Looks like this time Rayquaza is going back to its owner, Mio-chan.

579
00:33:45,048 --> 00:33:48,048
フブさんちょっと心配してたよね。このレックウザが無事...
Fubu-san was a bit worried, right? Hoping this Rayquaza...

580
00:33:48,048 --> 00:33:51,048
誰か持って帰ってください、ってね。
...would be safely taken home by someone.

581
00:33:51,048 --> 00:33:53,048
あ、でも...
Ah, but...

582
00:33:54,048 --> 00:33:56,548
あ、いいやん！後でね！
Ah, nice! Later then!

583
00:33:56,548 --> 00:33:58,548
後でね！そうめん美味い！
Later then! Soumen is delicious!

584
00:33:58,548 --> 00:34:01,048
Wait, why do I have them?

585
00:34:01,048 --> 00:34:03,548
Mizuame? Mizuame? / あ、そっちね！
Starch syrup? Starch syrup? / Ah, over there!

586
00:34:05,548 --> 00:34:08,048
やっと... あれ？フブちゃんが作ってる！
Finally... Huh? Fubu-chan is making it!

587
00:34:08,048 --> 00:34:10,548
キャー！マジで？！
Eek! Seriously?!

588
00:34:10,548 --> 00:34:13,048
すごい！ありがとうございます！
Amazing! Thank you very much!

589
00:34:13,548 --> 00:34:16,048
やっとのことで... なんか...
After all that... somehow...

590
00:34:16,048 --> 00:34:18,548
...I think... / え？
...I think... / Eh?

591
00:34:18,548 --> 00:34:21,048
I think I'm losing...

592
00:34:21,048 --> 00:34:24,048
出来上がってきた、これ！
It's coming together, this one!

593
00:34:24,048 --> 00:34:26,548
大変なことになってきた、これ！
This is turning into a mess!

594
00:34:26,548 --> 00:34:29,048
外れちゃってさ... オッケー、オッケー！
It came off... Okay, okay!

595
00:34:29,048 --> 00:34:31,548
なんか... なんかフブちゃん圧縮！
Somehow... Fubu-chan compressed it!

596
00:34:31,548 --> 00:34:34,048
すごい、スター...
Wow, star...

597
00:34:35,048 --> 00:34:38,048
キャー！可愛い！
Eek! So cute!

598
00:34:38,048 --> 00:34:40,548
一層...
Even more...

599
00:34:40,548 --> 00:34:43,048
でも美味いんですよ。それ、みおちゃんにあげないの？
But it's delicious. Aren't you giving that to Mio-chan?

600
00:34:43,048 --> 00:34:46,048
Eh? / 欲しい！
Eh? / I want it!

601
00:34:46,048 --> 00:34:48,548
That's a microphone!

602
00:34:48,548 --> 00:34:51,048
え？これ？！
Eh? This?!

603
00:34:51,048 --> 00:34:54,048
これちがうよ！
This isn't it!

604
00:34:54,048 --> 00:34:57,048
これちがうよ！
This isn't it!

605
00:34:57,048 --> 00:35:00,048
喜んでくれるかな？
I wonder if she'll be happy?

606
00:35:01,056 --> 00:35:02,156
I won!

607
00:35:03,556 --> 00:35:04,956
なんか止まってる
It's stuck!

608
00:35:05,156 --> 00:35:06,556
I won! I win!

609
00:35:07,556 --> 00:35:09,956
みなさん、これでございます
Everyone, here it is!

610
00:35:12,856 --> 00:35:13,256
ルーちゃんの綿あめ...
Lu-chan's cotton candy...

611
00:35:14,256 --> 00:35:15,956
ルーちゃん固まってる
Lu-chan's is hardening.

612
00:35:17,156 --> 00:35:18,856
上の部分はまだいいんだけどさ
The top part is still okay, but...

613
00:35:19,856 --> 00:35:20,956
これどうなったと思う？
What do you think happened to this?

614
00:35:21,556 --> 00:35:22,556
That's okay, people!

615
00:35:28,856 --> 00:35:30,256
雪みたいだね
It looks like snow!

616
00:35:33,856 --> 00:35:34,956
ありがとう！
Thank you!

617
00:35:36,556 --> 00:35:37,856
取れない！
I can't get it off!

618
00:35:41,556 --> 00:35:43,256
頑張って！
Do your best!

619
00:35:44,256 --> 00:35:47,256
ネリッサがハンバーガー...
Nerissa is holding a burger...

620
00:35:48,856 --> 00:35:50,156
なんで？
Why?

621
00:35:51,256 --> 00:35:52,856
これパテだよ！
This is a patty!

622
00:35:53,556 --> 00:35:55,256
パテだ、これ！
It's a patty, this!

623
00:36:01,856 --> 00:36:03,556
なんや、でっか！
What, it's huge!

624
00:36:07,156 --> 00:36:08,556
強そう！
It looks strong!

625
00:36:08,856 --> 00:36:10,056
見せて
Show me!

626
00:36:10,256 --> 00:36:12,056
強そう！
It looks strong!

627
00:36:15,556 --> 00:36:17,856
オッケー、行け！Let's go!
Okay, go! Let's go!

628
00:36:18,556 --> 00:36:21,056
ちょっと色...
A bit of color...

629
00:36:22,556 --> 00:36:24,256
なんやこれ！
What is this!

630
00:36:28,056 --> 00:36:29,856
乾杯！
Cheers!

631
00:36:31,556 --> 00:36:33,256
ありがとう！
Thank you!

632
00:36:39,056 --> 00:36:40,856
持って帰って...
Take it home...

633
00:36:42,856 --> 00:36:44,256
食べたいよ
I want to eat it.

634
00:36:45,056 --> 00:36:48,256
え、フワモコさ、なんか夏祭りの思い出とかある？
Eh, FuwaMoco, do you have any summer festival memories?

635
00:36:48,856 --> 00:36:50,056
ないです！
We don't!

636
00:36:50,556 --> 00:36:53,856
1個だけ！引っ越してからは行ってない...
Just one! We haven't gone since we moved...

637
00:36:54,156 --> 00:36:55,256
あ、そうなんだ！
Oh, really!

638
00:36:55,356 --> 00:36:57,256
夏祭りは1回しか行ってなくて
We've only gone to a summer festival once.

639
00:36:57,556 --> 00:37:00,256
りんご飴と、キャンディ！
Candy apple and candy!

640
00:37:05,156 --> 00:37:06,856
お願いします、先輩！
Please, Senpai!

641
00:37:07,556 --> 00:37:09,556
人形すくいやばい
Doll scooping is crazy.

642
00:37:11,856 --> 00:37:16,256
モコタがやってるときにちょっと勢いが強すぎて...
When Mocota was doing it, she was a bit too aggressive...

643
00:37:17,256 --> 00:37:20,056
金魚すくいが丘の上にあって...
The goldfish scooping was at the top of a hill...

644
00:37:21,856 --> 00:37:24,056
モコタ結構勢いよく...
And Mocota was pretty energetic...

645
00:37:24,556 --> 00:37:27,556
ぼーっとしてたら、金魚が...
While spacing out, the goldfish...

646
00:37:28,056 --> 00:37:32,856
足の裏、靴下についたのが気づかなくて...
didn't notice it got stuck to the bottom of her sock...

647
00:37:33,256 --> 00:37:38,856
体重を偶然にその靴下に、この足に...
And put her weight accidentally onto that sock, onto this foot...

648
00:37:39,556 --> 00:37:41,256
で、プチッて...
And squish...

649
00:37:41,856 --> 00:37:43,856
ねえ、やめてそれ！
Hey, stop that!

650
00:37:44,556 --> 00:37:46,856
歩いてたら...
While walking...

651
00:37:47,256 --> 00:37:50,856
踏まれて、その丘にコロコロコロ...
it got stepped on and rolled down the hill...

652
00:37:51,056 --> 00:37:53,856
そしたらその金魚が...
And then that goldfish...

653
00:37:54,056 --> 00:37:56,856
ねえ、なんでそんな怖いこと言うの！
Hey, why are you telling such a scary story!

654
00:37:55,556 --> 00:37:58,556
怖すぎる！
It's way too scary!

655
00:37:58,256 --> 00:38:00,056
金魚の思い出じゃないよ！
That's not a fond goldfish memory!

656
00:38:00,856 --> 00:38:03,256
これからカットしていきます
Now we're going to cut it.

657
00:38:03,856 --> 00:38:05,556
やばい、それ！
That's awful!

658
00:38:07,256 --> 00:38:09,556
ビブー、なんか思い出ある？夏祭りの
Biboo, do you have any memories of summer festivals?

659
00:38:10,056 --> 00:38:12,056
I remember the summer festival!

660
00:38:15,556 --> 00:38:17,056
あ、花火！
Ah, fireworks!

661
00:38:17,556 --> 00:38:20,056
花火！Fire... なんだっけ？
Fireworks! Fire... what was it?

662
00:38:20,256 --> 00:38:24,056
花火はいったよ！花火怖くて...
We went to see fireworks! Fireworks were scary...

663
00:38:24,556 --> 00:38:26,556
なんで？Why? Why scary?
Why? Why scary?

664
00:38:27,256 --> 00:38:28,556
Oh, big!

665
00:38:28,856 --> 00:38:30,256
あ、ビッグ！
Ah, big!

666
00:38:33,256 --> 00:38:34,856
ちょっとバンバンやめて！
Stop making bang sounds!

667
00:38:35,256 --> 00:38:37,856
ねえ、今さ、今ビブーが話してんのにさ...
Hey, right now while Biboo is speaking...

668
00:38:38,056 --> 00:38:41,256
マジ、もうバンバンバンってフワモコが...
Seriously, FuwaMoco is just going bang bang bang...

669
00:38:41,856 --> 00:38:44,256
フワモコやめなさい！暴れるのは！
FuwaMoco, stop wilding out!

670
00:38:44,556 --> 00:38:47,056
ビブー勝つ！あ、勝ったね！
Biboo wins! Ah, she won!

671
00:38:47,256 --> 00:38:51,056
これ取れて... ビブー！ビブー！
She got this... Biboo! Biboo!

672
00:38:52,556 --> 00:38:58,256
ビブーが話してんのにビブーが取ってくれたヨーヨーでこうバンバンやってんのやばいだろ、ビブーに向かって！
Doing bang bang at Biboo with the yo-yo she got for you while she's talking is crazy!

673
00:38:59,256 --> 00:39:02,056
ちなみにネリッサは夏祭りの...
By the way, Nerissa, any summer festival memories?

674
00:39:03,056 --> 00:39:04,556
Yummy yummy! うれしい！
Yummy yummy! I'm happy!

675
00:39:06,856 --> 00:39:08,056
ありがとう！
Thank you!

676
00:39:09,256 --> 00:39:11,856
すいません、これ壊しました！
Sorry, we broke this!

677
00:39:12,056 --> 00:39:14,556
フワモコが壊しました、これ！強すぎた！
FuwaMoco broke this! It was too strong!

678
00:39:17,256 --> 00:39:18,856
フワモコやばいだろ！
FuwaMoco is insane!

679
00:39:19,256 --> 00:39:22,056
別の黄色のヨーヨーダメだったね
The other yellow yo-yo didn't work, right?

680
00:39:22,256 --> 00:39:26,056
ヨーヨーダメだったからやめて、ヨーヨーダメだったね
The yo-yo didn't work so stop, the yo-yo didn't work.

681
00:39:27,556 --> 00:39:29,056
ヨーヨーのせいだ！
It's the yo-yo's fault!

682
00:39:29,256 --> 00:39:32,056
ヨーヨーのせいじゃねえよ！
It's NOT the yo-yo's fault!

683
00:39:32,856 --> 00:39:36,056
これさ、ミオちゃんが1個1個作ったの！
Mio-chan made these one by one!

684
00:39:36,256 --> 00:39:39,256
みお先輩、ありがとうございます！
Mio-senpai, thank you very much!

685
00:39:40,256 --> 00:39:42,056
やったー！
Yay!

686
00:39:44,256 --> 00:39:47,056
え、もう1個？もう1個いいよ！
Eh, another one? Another one is fine!

687
00:39:47,256 --> 00:39:50,056
取ってくれました！新しいのもいいですか？
She got it for us! Is a new one okay too?

688
00:39:51,256 --> 00:39:53,056
いいよ、いいよ！
Sure, go ahead!

689
00:39:54,056 --> 00:39:57,056
You make me go again? You can take any one!

690
00:39:58,256 --> 00:39:59,856
Nice!

691
00:40:01,364 --> 00:40:02,364
あ、本当だ
Oh, you're right.

692
00:40:02,364 --> 00:40:03,864
え、これ、ヨーヨーも見せる？
Wait, should I show the yo-yos too?

693
00:40:06,164 --> 00:40:07,564
グレープソーダ
Grape soda.

694
00:40:07,864 --> 00:40:09,164
おー！
Oh!

695
00:40:09,164 --> 00:40:10,564
たぶん...
Probably...

696
00:40:11,264 --> 00:40:12,764
あ、ケチャップだ！
Ah, it's ketchup!

697
00:40:15,564 --> 00:40:16,864
ワイン！
Wine!

698
00:40:16,864 --> 00:40:18,864
No, that one, that one. Which one?

699
00:40:18,864 --> 00:40:20,564
Which one? Oh my god.

700
00:40:22,564 --> 00:40:24,064
飴、えっと、どうやって作るんですか？
How do you make the cotton candy?

701
00:40:24,064 --> 00:40:25,864
え、まず好きな色を選んで...
First, pick your favorite color...

702
00:40:27,064 --> 00:40:29,564
So pretty! すごく綺麗！
So pretty!

703
00:40:30,064 --> 00:40:31,564
何色にする？
What color do you want?

704
00:40:31,564 --> 00:40:33,864
今まで何色...もうちょっと優しくするね。
What colors so far... I'll go easier on you.

705
00:40:34,264 --> 00:40:37,064
えー、でもオレンジ...オレンジとか作った？みおちゃん。
Eh, but orange... Did we make orange yet, Mio-chan?

706
00:40:37,064 --> 00:40:38,264
はーい！
Yes!

707
00:40:38,264 --> 00:40:40,864
みおちゃん、今日まだ出てない色ある？
Mio-chan, are there any colors we haven't used today?

708
00:40:40,864 --> 00:40:42,264
オレンジまだかも。
Maybe orange isn't used yet.

709
00:40:42,264 --> 00:40:43,664
オレンジまだだって！
She says orange hasn't been used!

710
00:40:43,664 --> 00:40:45,064
じゃあオレンジにしよっか。
Then let's make orange.

711
00:40:45,064 --> 00:40:47,164
じゃあオレンジ、あー、このカップに入れてください。
Then please put orange into this cup.

712
00:40:47,164 --> 00:40:48,064
はい！
Okay!

713
00:40:48,064 --> 00:40:49,864
ハイ、ノー、ハイ！
High, low, high!

714
00:40:49,864 --> 00:40:51,264
あら、夢見がちね。
My, aren't you a dreamer?

715
00:40:52,264 --> 00:40:55,264
この辺オレンジつけるだろ。つけるだろ。
Putting orange around here, right? Right?

716
00:40:56,164 --> 00:40:59,064
はい、これで一杯ね、やってください。
Okay, use one full cup of this.

717
00:40:59,064 --> 00:40:59,864
うい。
Yep.

718
00:40:59,864 --> 00:41:01,064
大丈夫？
Is it alright?

719
00:41:02,064 --> 00:41:04,564
で、この真ん中に入れて...
And put it right in the middle...

720
00:41:04,564 --> 00:41:06,064
そう！
That's it!

721
00:41:08,564 --> 00:41:10,064
You making that? How's it going?

722
00:41:10,064 --> 00:41:11,264
It's going okay.

723
00:41:11,864 --> 00:41:14,564
これ入れてスイッチオンしてしばし待つ。
Put it in, turn on the switch, and wait a bit.

724
00:41:15,064 --> 00:41:17,064
Yeah, which one?

725
00:41:17,064 --> 00:41:18,164
あん！
Ah!

726
00:41:18,164 --> 00:41:20,564
お！え？完成？
Oh! Huh? Finished?

727
00:41:20,564 --> 00:41:22,564
えーっと、これを...
Um, this...

728
00:41:23,064 --> 00:41:24,064
ピザ！
Pizza!

729
00:41:24,064 --> 00:41:27,564
ねぇ、コメントで「ヨーヨーで暴れてるの誰？」って言われてるよ。
Hey, comments are asking "Who's going wild with the yo-yo?"

730
00:41:28,064 --> 00:41:29,864
誰ですか？ヨーヨーで暴れてるの。
Who is going wild with the yo-yo?

731
00:41:31,064 --> 00:41:33,064
ボコちゃん！
Moko-chan!

732
00:41:33,064 --> 00:41:35,064
I'll make it together!

733
00:41:35,064 --> 00:41:37,064
ヨーヨーで遊んでんの。
Playing with the yo-yo.

734
00:41:38,264 --> 00:41:41,564
それてくるくるくるーってしたら垂れて...
And if you spin it round and round, then...

735
00:41:42,064 --> 00:41:43,564
もうちょっとね、もうちょっとね。
A little bit more, a little bit more.

736
00:41:44,264 --> 00:41:47,064
ここにあのコットンキャンディーティーチャー...
Here, our cotton candy teacher...

737
00:41:47,064 --> 00:41:50,064
コットンキャンディーティーチャー・みぶさんがいますから。
Cotton candy teacher Mibu-san is here.

738
00:41:50,064 --> 00:41:52,064
みぶさんは今バーガーを...
Mibu-san is currently doing burgers...

739
00:41:52,064 --> 00:41:54,064
はい、代わります。
Okay, taking over.

740
00:41:54,064 --> 00:41:56,064
いいよ、みぶさん。
Go ahead, Mibu-san.

741
00:41:59,064 --> 00:42:02,564
I don't have Hasami...

742
00:42:04,064 --> 00:42:06,064
We have Hasami.

743
00:42:09,564 --> 00:42:12,564
ずっと棒を挿す...あ、待つしかねぇんだ！
Keep inserting the stick... Ah, we just have to wait!

744
00:42:13,064 --> 00:42:14,564
待つしかないんだよ。
We just have to wait.

745
00:42:16,064 --> 00:42:18,564
え、ハコスさん、夏の思い出ある？
Eh, Hakos-san, do you have any summer memories?

746
00:42:18,564 --> 00:42:20,264
夏の思い出？夏祭り、夏祭り！
Summer memories? Summer festival, summer festival!

747
00:42:20,264 --> 00:42:22,864
祭りの思い出ないっしょ？だって本当の祭りは...
No memories of festivals, right? Because real festivals...

748
00:42:22,864 --> 00:42:24,564
行ったことないんじゃ...
You haven't been to one...

749
00:42:24,564 --> 00:42:25,864
そうだ、言ってたわ！
Oh right, she did say that!

750
00:42:26,564 --> 00:42:28,064
ないよ！
None!

751
00:42:28,064 --> 00:42:30,064
食べたい！
I want to eat!

752
00:42:30,064 --> 00:42:32,864
ちょっと待って、モコちゃん...
Wait a second, Moko-chan...

753
00:42:33,264 --> 00:42:37,064
モコちゃん、あのさ、ヨーヨーで暴れるのやめてずっとさ...
Moko-chan, stop going wild with the yo-yo...

754
00:42:37,064 --> 00:42:38,564
暴れてない！
I'm not going wild!

755
00:42:38,564 --> 00:42:40,864
モコちゃん、これしてこれして！
Moko-chan, do this, do this!

756
00:42:41,064 --> 00:42:43,064
大丈夫？本当に。
Are you really okay?

757
00:42:46,064 --> 00:42:48,564
You haven't eaten? No, of course I will.

758
00:42:49,064 --> 00:42:50,564
あーいいね！
Oh, nice!

759
00:42:51,064 --> 00:42:53,064
Yeah, people already gave up.

760
00:42:53,564 --> 00:42:55,864
これはみおちゃんのお手本...
This is Mio-chan's sample...

761
00:42:55,864 --> 00:42:57,864
Look how I'm doing it.

762
00:42:57,864 --> 00:42:59,864
I don't know how this happened.

763
00:43:00,064 --> 00:43:02,064
Somehow I'm not surprised.

764
00:43:02,564 --> 00:43:04,564
あ、出た出た！
Ah, it came out!

765
00:43:04,564 --> 00:43:06,564
No, no, I wanted to make a burger.

766
00:43:08,064 --> 00:43:10,864
Yes, I'm... I love burgers.

