00:53:37,080 --> 00:53:40,580
どうしたらいいのこれ？笑ってないで！
What should I do with this? Stop laughing!

973
00:53:40,580 --> 00:53:44,580
ねねが壊す、やめろ
Nene is gonna break it, stop.

974
00:53:44,580 --> 00:53:47,580
助けて！
Help me!

975
00:53:47,580 --> 00:53:51,080
うわー！
Woah!

976
00:53:51,080 --> 00:53:54,580
すごーい！
Amazing!

977
00:53:54,580 --> 00:53:58,080
あははは！
Hahaha!

978
00:53:58,080 --> 00:54:01,580
やったー！
Hooray!

979
00:54:01,580 --> 00:54:05,080
ビブスの手に付いた！ネリッサ！
It stuck to Biboo's hand! Nerissa!

980
00:54:05,080 --> 00:54:08,580
あー！
Ah!

981
00:54:08,580 --> 00:54:11,580
注文お願い！注文お願いします！
Order please! Order please!

982
00:54:11,580 --> 00:54:14,580
完成品！
Finished product!

983
00:54:14,580 --> 00:54:18,080
バーガー＆ポテト
Burger & fries.

984
00:54:18,080 --> 00:54:22,080
コーラつき！コーラつき！
With Cola! With Cola!

985
00:54:22,080 --> 00:54:25,580
ネリッサが作ったね、スーパーティーだし
Nerissa made it, and it's Super Tea.

986
00:54:25,580 --> 00:54:28,580
うわー！
Woah!

987
00:54:28,580 --> 00:54:32,080
そしてハジメの作った...
And the one Hajime made...

988
00:54:32,080 --> 00:54:35,580
やったー！お茶あめです
Yay! It's tea candy.

989
00:54:35,580 --> 00:54:38,580
いただきます
Bon appétit.

990
00:54:38,580 --> 00:54:41,580
これ、ビブ...
This, Bib...

991
00:54:41,580 --> 00:54:45,080
食べてみてください
Please try eating it.

992
00:54:45,080 --> 00:54:48,580
いただきます、硬くて...
Bon appétit, it's hard...

993
00:54:48,580 --> 00:54:52,080
粘土みたいになるんだ、綿あめが...
It becomes like clay, the cotton candy...

994
00:54:52,080 --> 00:54:55,580
えー、そうだんだ！
Eh, really?!

995
00:54:55,580 --> 00:54:59,080
噛めないでしょ
You can't chew it, right?

996
00:55:00,688 --> 00:55:01,388
何ポイント？
How many points?

997
00:55:01,388 --> 00:55:03,088
100 points! Nice, nice!

998
00:55:03,088 --> 00:55:05,588
MAX 100 points?

999
00:55:06,388 --> 00:55:07,888
何ポイントこれ？
How many points is this?

1000
00:55:08,588 --> 00:55:10,588
すごい！マジ？
Amazing! Really?

1001
00:55:10,988 --> 00:55:12,888
10 points!

1002
00:55:13,588 --> 00:55:15,388
優しい！
So kind!

1003
00:55:15,588 --> 00:55:18,588
買い出し行って参る！
I'm off to buy supplies!

1004
00:55:21,888 --> 00:55:23,888
わたあめ欲しいな
I want cotton candy.

1005
00:55:24,588 --> 00:55:27,088
ありがとうございます！
Thank you very much!

1006
00:55:27,588 --> 00:55:29,888
食べつくす！
Devour it all!

1007
00:55:30,888 --> 00:55:33,088
あ！なんか煙出てる！
Ah! Smoke is coming out!

1008
00:55:33,288 --> 00:55:35,888
今オフになってるけど...
It's turned off right now, but...

1009
00:55:36,588 --> 00:55:39,288
わたあめ屋、一回飛びます！
Cotton candy shop is temporarily taking a break!

1010
00:55:39,588 --> 00:55:41,288
ごめんね一回...
Sorry, just for a moment...

1011
00:55:41,888 --> 00:55:45,088
ヤバい！ねねち、ハジメがわたあめ機壊した！
Oh no! Nenechi, Hajime broke the cotton candy machine!

1012
00:55:45,188 --> 00:55:47,588
ごめんなさい！
I'm so sorry!

1013
00:55:48,088 --> 00:55:51,588
ヤバい！煙がヤバい！
Oh no! The smoke is crazy!

1014
00:55:51,888 --> 00:55:53,888
見ちゃったよ...
I saw it...

1015
00:55:55,888 --> 00:55:59,288
それ危ないんで... メンテナンス中だね、これ。
That's dangerous... It's under maintenance now.

1016
00:55:59,588 --> 00:56:02,888
メンテナンス...
Maintenance...

1017
00:56:03,288 --> 00:56:06,088
あ、ボタン押すと必ず煙出てる...
Ah, whenever you press the button, smoke comes out...

1018
00:56:06,088 --> 00:56:08,588
じゃあ大丈夫か。もうちょっとで出来る。
Then is it fine? It'll be ready soon.

1019
00:56:08,888 --> 00:56:10,588
美味しい！
Delicious!

1020
00:56:10,088 --> 00:56:13,288
めでたい！
Congratulations!

1021
00:56:13,588 --> 00:56:16,088
あ、それオンになってる！
Ah, that's turned ON!

1022
00:56:19,588 --> 00:56:21,088
お掃除...
Cleaning...

1023
00:56:21,288 --> 00:56:25,888
じゃあわたあめ屋さん、ちょっと一回休止です。
Okay, so the cotton candy shop is temporarily closed.

1024
00:56:25,888 --> 00:56:28,088
メンテナンスが入ります！
Maintenance in progress!

1025
00:56:30,088 --> 00:56:32,588
ごちそうさでした！
Thank you for the treat!

1026
00:56:32,588 --> 00:56:34,588
美味しかった！
It was delicious!

1027
00:56:37,088 --> 00:56:39,088
うわー！
Woah!

1028
00:56:39,288 --> 00:56:41,088
リアル...
So realistic...

1029
00:56:43,888 --> 00:56:46,588
Is that yakisoba, yum?

1030
00:56:46,588 --> 00:56:48,588
Oh, no...

1031
00:56:48,588 --> 00:56:51,588
Gummy candy?

1032
00:56:51,588 --> 00:56:54,088
Oh, why? I'm scared.

1033
00:56:57,088 --> 00:56:59,888
You gave that one time!

1034
00:56:59,888 --> 00:57:02,588
That was for my life! It's yummy!

1035
00:57:02,588 --> 00:57:05,088
最後！最後！
Last one! Last one!

1036
00:57:06,288 --> 00:57:08,088
おい！
Hey!

1037
00:57:08,588 --> 00:57:11,288
ヤバい！来い！
Oh no! Come on!

1038
00:57:11,288 --> 00:57:13,588
ねねち行ける？
Can you get it, Nenechi?

1039
00:57:13,588 --> 00:57:15,588
行けないかも... 頑張って！
Maybe I can't... Do your best!

1040
00:57:16,588 --> 00:57:19,588
フミ頑張れ！行けないかも...
Fumi, do your best! Maybe I can't...

1041
00:57:19,888 --> 00:57:23,288
ちなみにみおちゃんとビブーは成功してる。
By the way, Mio-chan and Bijou succeeded.

1042
00:57:23,288 --> 00:57:25,088
なんで？！どうやって？！
Why?! How?!

1043
00:57:25,088 --> 00:57:27,588
聞いたらね、「えぇっ？」てなるよ。
If you hear how, you'll go "Ehh?!"

1044
00:57:27,588 --> 00:57:30,088
If you're gonna feed it to someone else...

1045
00:57:30,288 --> 00:57:32,588
頑張れ、ねねち！
Do your best, Nenechi!

1046
00:57:34,888 --> 00:57:39,588
実力で取ってたよ、ちゃんと。2個取り！
They got it with pure skill properly. Two at once!

1047
00:57:39,588 --> 00:57:41,288
あー！
Ahhh!

1048
00:57:41,288 --> 00:57:43,888
やっぱり欲張ると良くないね。
As expected, being greedy isn't good.

1049
00:57:43,888 --> 00:57:46,588
もう一回いいよ。
You can try one more time.

1050
00:57:46,588 --> 00:57:50,088
これちなみにみおちゃんが全部手作りしてるから。
By the way, Mio-chan made all of these by hand.

1051
00:57:50,088 --> 00:57:52,088
すごい！
Amazing!

1052
00:57:54,088 --> 00:57:57,088
やっぱりドーンと入れるわけじゃないですよ。
You're not supposed to just slam it in.

1053
00:57:58,288 --> 00:58:01,888
はい！そうめん屋へいらっしゃい、いらっしゃい！
Yes! Welcome to the somen shop! Welcome!

1054
00:58:02,888 --> 00:58:06,088
えーっと... オッケー、待ちました！
Ummm... Okay, ready!

1055
00:58:06,088 --> 00:58:08,588
ーい！流します！
Yayy! Sending it down!

1056
00:58:13,888 --> 00:58:16,888
ここを通るの信じて！
Believe it's gonna pass through here!

1057
00:58:16,888 --> 00:58:19,088
ナイッショ！ナイッショ！取れた！
Nice shot! Nice shot! Caught it!

1058
00:58:19,088 --> 00:58:21,588
もう一回！もう一回おいで！
One more time! Come one more time!

1059
00:58:21,588 --> 00:58:24,088
気をつけて！罰ゲームのやつ...
Be careful! That's the punishment game one...

1060
00:58:24,088 --> 00:58:26,588
大丈夫、大丈夫。
It's okay, it's okay.

1061
00:58:27,088 --> 00:58:30,088
勝った勝った勝った！頼んだ！
Won won won! I left it to you!

1062
00:58:30,088 --> 00:58:33,088
あー！
Ahhh!

1063
00:58:33,288 --> 00:58:36,088
やったー！本当に辛かったよね。
Yay! That was really spicy, right?

1064
00:58:39,888 --> 00:58:43,088
Okay, yeah. I don't want pizza.

1065
00:58:43,888 --> 00:58:46,088
大丈夫、大丈夫。
It's okay, it's okay.

1066
00:58:47,088 --> 00:58:50,088
バンってやると...
If you slam it...

1067
00:58:52,088 --> 00:58:54,088
あ、ホントだ！
Ah, it's true!

1068
00:58:54,088 --> 00:58:56,588
猫が喜びそう！
Cats would love this!

1069
00:58:56,888 --> 00:59:00,088
これやめなさい！このバシバシバシバシやめなさい！
Stop doing that! Stop doing that aggressive slapping!

1070
00:59:00,088 --> 00:59:02,888
またバシバシしてる！
Slapping it again!

1071
00:59:02,888 --> 00:59:05,588
イエーイ！
Yay!

1072
00:59:05,588 --> 00:59:07,588
共鳴、共鳴！
Resonance, resonance!

1073
00:59:07,588 --> 00:59:10,588
お！燃えたお！
Oh! It lit up!

1074
00:59:10,588 --> 00:59:14,088
イエーイ！
Yaaaaay!

1075
00:59:14,588 --> 00:59:17,588
綺麗！
So pretty!

1076
00:59:18,088 --> 00:59:21,088
流しちゃってる... あーららら
It's washing away... Ah la la

1077
00:59:21,088 --> 00:59:23,588
大丈夫、大丈夫。ねーさま可愛い。
It's okay, it's okay. Sister is so cute.

1078
00:59:27,888 --> 00:59:31,088
え、そこからね、回収されてまたね、そうめんになる。
Eh, from there it gets collected and becomes somen again.

1079
00:59:31,088 --> 00:59:33,588
変なギミック！
What a weird gimmick!

1080
00:59:33,588 --> 00:59:36,088
無限にそうめんだよ！無限そうめん！
It's infinite somen! Infinite somen!

1081
00:59:36,088 --> 00:59:39,088
はーい！いらっしゃいー！
Yes! Welcome!

1082
00:59:39,588 --> 00:59:42,088
お客さま！
Customer!

1083
00:59:42,088 --> 00:59:45,088
ちゃんとね、マナーがありますからね。
There are proper manners, after all.

1084
00:59:45,088 --> 00:59:47,588
お客さまー！
Customer~!

1085
00:59:47,588 --> 00:59:50,088
お客さま大丈夫ですかー？気をつけてね！
Customer, are you alright~? Be careful!

1086
00:59:51,088 --> 00:59:53,888
こっからね、こうやって...
From here, like this...

1087
00:59:54,088 --> 00:59:57,088
これ壊さないでね！壊さないでハジメ！
Don't break this! Don't break it, Hajime!

1088
00:59:57,088 --> 00:59:59,888
流します！
Sending it down!

1089
01:00:01,096 --> 01:00:02,596
頑張れー！
Hang in there!

1090
01:00:02,596 --> 01:00:04,096
おっ、やった！
Oh, nice!

1091
01:00:04,096 --> 01:00:05,896
大丈夫？
Are you okay?

1092
01:00:05,896 --> 01:00:07,596
全然大丈夫！
It's completely fine!

1093
01:00:09,596 --> 01:00:11,896
Push it with people...

1094
01:00:12,096 --> 01:00:14,296
My hand's tickling in it.

1095
01:00:14,296 --> 01:00:16,296
I like your fingers.

1096
01:00:18,096 --> 01:00:20,596
Your fingers in my mouth... Great.

1097
01:00:23,096 --> 01:00:25,596
流しそうめん、超小さいからね。
The nagashi somen is super small, after all.

1098
01:00:25,596 --> 01:00:27,596
チーズの匂いがする。
It smells like cheese.

1099
01:00:27,596 --> 01:00:29,096
そうめん！
Somen!

1100
01:00:29,096 --> 01:00:31,096
痛いの？
Does it hurt?

1101
01:00:31,096 --> 01:00:33,596
なんかキャンディだけどチーズの匂い。
It's like candy, but it smells like cheese.

1102
01:00:33,596 --> 01:00:36,096
本当だー！
It really does!

1103
01:00:38,896 --> 01:00:41,296
スバルの食べないからね。
Subaru won't eat it, you know.

1104
01:00:41,296 --> 01:00:43,896
みこちゃんが食べてくれる？
Will Miko-chan eat it for us?

1105
01:00:45,596 --> 01:00:47,896
Eat it, sweetie!

1106
01:00:47,896 --> 01:00:51,596
You got it, you did it!

1107
01:00:55,296 --> 01:00:58,096
変えて変えて！なんかマジやばい。
Switch it, switch it! This is really bad.

1108
01:00:58,096 --> 01:01:00,896
ちょっと無くした？
Wait, did you lose it?

1109
01:01:05,596 --> 01:01:08,596
初めてのヨーヨー無くしたの？
Did you lose your first yo-yo?

1110
01:01:08,596 --> 01:01:12,096
ヨーヨーが無くなったとか...
She says she lost her yo-yo...

1111
01:01:13,596 --> 01:01:16,096
流しそうめん...
Nagashi somen...

1112
01:01:16,096 --> 01:01:18,596
先輩、もう一回お願い...
Senpai, please do it one more time...

1113
01:01:19,596 --> 01:01:22,596
ヨーヨー消えたんで、後でもう一回やってください。
The yo-yo disappeared, so please try again later.

1114
01:01:23,596 --> 01:01:26,596
一緒にやりたいな！
I want to do it together!

1115
01:01:26,596 --> 01:01:28,596
Yucky, yucky!

1116
01:01:29,596 --> 01:01:32,096
またネジが壊れた！
The screw broke again!

1117
01:01:32,596 --> 01:01:35,096
もう一回、もう一回！
One more time, one more time!

1118
01:01:35,596 --> 01:01:38,096
え、この紐フブキ先輩の？
Huh, is this string Fubuki-senpai's?

1119
01:01:39,596 --> 01:01:42,096
あー！行けたー！
Ah! It worked!

1120
01:01:42,096 --> 01:01:45,096
行けた、行けた！ありがとうございます！
It worked, it worked! Thank you so much!

1121
01:01:45,596 --> 01:01:48,596
You're very welcome! Wanna make it for other people?

1122
01:01:48,596 --> 01:01:51,596
フブちゃんもやってみたい！
Fubu-chan wants to try it too!

1123
01:01:51,596 --> 01:01:53,896
Here's the pizza!

1124
01:01:53,896 --> 01:01:55,596
わんこそば！
Wanko soba!

1125
01:02:00,096 --> 01:02:02,596
どんどん言ったらいいんじゃない？
Wouldn't it be better to just keep putting them in?

1126
01:02:03,096 --> 01:02:06,096
そうめん流してー！
Send down the somen!

1127
01:02:08,096 --> 01:02:10,596
It was dirty! Oh, you want it?

1128
01:02:13,596 --> 01:02:15,596
回転させよう！
Let's make it spin!

1129
01:02:15,596 --> 01:02:18,096
Open wide!

1130
01:02:28,596 --> 01:02:31,096
I'll play with my toys.

1131
01:02:31,096 --> 01:02:33,596
渡してどうかな？
How about handing it over?

1132
01:02:33,596 --> 01:02:36,096
あるある！じゃあ行こうか。
There is! Then shall we go?

1133
01:02:36,096 --> 01:02:38,096
You can do it!

1134
01:02:39,096 --> 01:02:42,096
ちょっと難しい...
It's a bit difficult...

1135
01:02:42,096 --> 01:02:44,096
優しくね！
Gently!

1136
01:02:44,596 --> 01:02:47,896
失敗するわけないんだから！
There's no way we'll fail!

1137
01:02:55,096 --> 01:02:58,096
取れたー！
I got it!

1138
01:03:00,896 --> 01:03:03,096
セーフ！
Safe!

1139
01:03:06,096 --> 01:03:08,596
やったー！
Yay!

1140
01:03:10,096 --> 01:03:12,596
Oh, so wet!

1141
01:03:17,096 --> 01:03:19,596
リプニの匂いがする。
It smells like Lipovitan.

1142
01:03:21,096 --> 01:03:24,096
遊びてぇよ！
I wanna play!

1143
01:03:28,596 --> 01:03:31,596
Yeah, the ketchup!

1144
01:03:35,596 --> 01:03:38,596
やばい、やばい！
Oh no, oh no!

1145
01:03:48,596 --> 01:03:51,096
いいね！
Nice!

1146
01:03:53,596 --> 01:03:56,096
Don't break it!

1147
01:03:57,096 --> 01:04:00,596
There's so many steps, look at that!

1148
01:04:01,096 --> 01:04:03,596
I can't do this!

1149
01:04:03,596 --> 01:04:06,096
Yes, you can! You have to commit!

1150
01:04:10,596 --> 01:04:13,096
えー、何？
Eh, what?

1151
01:04:14,096 --> 01:04:17,096
雑祭りだからね！
Because it's a chaotic festival!

1152
01:04:18,096 --> 01:04:21,096
可愛い！
So cute!

1153
01:04:22,596 --> 01:04:25,596
これで自己紹介してー。
Introduce yourself with this.

1154
01:04:26,596 --> 01:04:29,096
美味しい！
Delicious!

1155
01:04:33,096 --> 01:04:35,596
Use my hand, okay?

1156
01:04:36,596 --> 01:04:39,596
取れない！
I can't get it!

1157
01:04:41,096 --> 01:04:44,096
I need to do this!

1158
01:04:44,096 --> 01:04:47,096
I don't like how it feels!

1159
01:04:49,096 --> 01:04:52,596
I need to cut it to pieces!

1160
01:04:53,596 --> 01:04:56,096
あ、キレイ！
Ah, pretty!

1161
01:04:56,096 --> 01:04:59,096
やったー！
Yay!

1162
01:05:13,304 --> 01:05:15,604
そうめんください！
Somen, please!

1163
01:05:16,104 --> 01:05:18,504
うわー、でもチーズのがヤバいこれ
Whoa, but the cheese one is crazy!

1164
01:05:20,604 --> 01:05:23,104
固まりになっちゃう
It's going to clump up and turn into a blob.

1165
01:05:33,904 --> 01:05:36,604
回収して！ちゃんと回収して！
Collect it! Collect it properly!

1166
01:05:37,604 --> 01:05:40,104
え、今わたあめ作ってるの誰？
Wait, who's making cotton candy right now?

1167
01:05:40,304 --> 01:05:43,104
ちゃんと回収してね！
Collect it properly, okay?

1168
01:05:46,604 --> 01:05:49,104
うわ、美味そう！
Whoa, looks delicious!

1169
01:05:51,904 --> 01:05:55,604
あ、これ固まるから...
Ah, because this hardens...

1170
01:06:03,104 --> 01:06:05,104
当たり前でしょ！
Well of course!

1171
01:06:09,604 --> 01:06:13,104
It smells! It smells like bacon!

1172
01:06:17,304 --> 01:06:19,104
大丈夫！
It's fine! Don't worry!

1173
01:06:22,604 --> 01:06:26,604
I can smell it from here, and I'm like 5 steps away!
I can smell it from here, and I'm 5 steps away!

1174
01:06:33,304 --> 01:06:36,104
すごい！すごい！すごい尖ってきた
Amazing! It got super sharp!

1175
01:06:40,904 --> 01:06:43,104
バレバレじゃん！
